async function saveFogd(kind,key,data){if(!rootDir)return false;let p=await rootDir.queryPermission({mode:'readwrite'});if(p!=='granted')p=await rootDir.requestPermission({mode:'readwrite'});if(p!=='granted')return false;let d=await rootDir.getDirectoryHandle(kind==='G'?'Galop Arşivi':'Orijin Arşivi',{create:true}),year=fogdYear(data),y=await d.getDirectoryHandle(year,{create:true}),fh=await y.getFileHandle(String(key)+'.json',{create:true}),w=await fh.createWritable();await w.write(JSON.stringify({version:'AT-FOGD-LOCAL-V2',savedAt:new Date().toISOString(),year,key:String(key),data},null,2));await w.close();return true}
